OL,3,ABangkok roads submerged as flood
OL,4,Adisaster declared
OL,5,
OL,6,FThunderstorms are common in Thailand at
OL,7,Fthis time of year but extreme weather
OL,8,Fin recent days has inundated Bangkok's
OL,9,Fdrainage system, causing traffic chaos
OL,10,Fon roads that are already famously
OL,11,Fcongested.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
